<view class="cart-page page-with-bottom">
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="state-block empty-cart">
    <view class="state-mark">空</view>
    <view class="state-title">购物车还是空的</view>
    <view class="state-desc">先去菜单挑几道菜。购物车只记录份数与备注，不涉及金额。</view>
    <view class="state-action" bindtap="goMenu">去点餐</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="cart-head">
      <view>
        <view class="cart-title">已选 {{kinds}} 种</view>
        <view class="tiny">共 {{count}} 份 · 提交后商家直接看到</view>
      </view>
      <view class="clear-link" bindtap="clearAll">清空</view>
    </view>

    <view class="cart-list">
      <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="dishId" class="cart-item">
        <view class="cart-art">
          <dish-art image-key="{{item.imageKey}}" name="{{item.nameZh}}" />
        </view>
        <view class="cart-info">
          <view class="cart-name ellipsis">{{item.nameZh}}</view>
          <view class="cart-intro clamp-2">{{item.introZh || '现点现做，热乎上桌。'}}</view>
          <view class="cart-row">
            <text class="tiny">份数</text>
            <view class="stepper sm">
              <view
                class="step-btn"
                catchtap="minus"
                data-id="{{item.dishId}}"
                data-qty="{{item.qty}}"
              >−</view>
              <view class="step-q">{{item.qty}}</view>
              <view
                class="step-btn"
                catchtap="plus"
                data-id="{{item.dishId}}"
                data-qty="{{item.qty}}"
              >+</view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="remark-card card">
      <view class="remark-top">
        <view>
          <view class="remark-title">整单备注</view>
          <view class="tiny">口味、忌口、装盘要求都可以写</view>
        </view>
        <view class="remark-count">{{remarkLen}}/60</view>
      </view>
      <textarea
        class="remark-input"
        value="{{remark}}"
        maxlength="60"
        placeholder="例如：少盐、不放葱、米饭分开装"
        placeholder-class="input-ph"
        bindinput="onRemark"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="note-line">
      <view class="note-dot">i</view>
      <text>本期不包含价格与支付。提交订单后，商家在订单看板收到这一单，并按份数开始制作。</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<view class="bottom-bar cart-bottom" wx:if="{{items.length}}">
  <view class="cb-sum">
    <view class="cb-count">{{count}} 份</view>
    <view class="tiny">共 {{kinds}} 道菜</view>
  </view>
  <view class="cb-btn {{submitting ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交订单'}}</view>
</view>
